    "piston_runs": "Criterion, 20 samples per fresh process, 1-second warmup and 3-second measurement. Baseline-1, optimized-1, optimized-2, baseline-2 cover 1, 64, 256 and 1,024 independent pistons. Each cycle contains eight interpreted game ticks and manual power changes. Affinity mask 4, Normal priority.",
